{"kind": "pdf_page", "number": 59, "text": "割\n地\n赔\n偿\n不\n两\n全\n一\n九\n一\n九\n•\n七\n.\n一\n四\n德\n国\n答\n复\n协\n约\n国\n，\n说\n，\n如\n失\n去\n西\n里\n细\n亚\n及\n萨\n尔\n煤\n矿\n，\n则\n无\n力\n履\n行\n赔\n偿\n。\n我\n料\n协\n约\n国\n听\n了\n \n一\n定\n狠\n烦\n脑\n。 \n何\n以\n故\n？ \n地\n可\n割\n，\n赔\n偿\n也\n可\n得\n，\n最\n为\n两\n全\n。\n据\n德\n国\n的\n说\n，\n两\n样\n便\n成\n了\n反\n比\n例\n，\n如\n之\n何\n不\n烦\n脑\n？\n虽\n然\n， \n奉\n劝\n协\n约\n国\n的\n衮\n衮\n诸\n公\n天\n下\n那\n有\n两\n全\n的\n好\n事\n！\no\n湘\n江\n评\n论\n \n创\n刊\n号\n \n一\n九\n一\n九\n•\n七\n.\n一\n四\n割\n地\n赔\n偿\n不\n两\n全\n \n五\n五\n", "printed_page": null, "witness_id": "A-c0966a995bb82067c6e1", "source_url": "https://www.marxists.org/chinese/pdf/chinese_marxists/mao/1-01.pdf", "source_raw_sha256": "7db0eec5b88cfce1aa460bc3eadb94b6f984f2e477536f1c7ca3709f641b9e60", "edition_refs": [{"edition_id": "mia-bujuan-9", "volume": 1, "basis": "source_catalogue_not_print_collation"}], "source_text_sha256": "b0ca47d12c3f293a5172d615966fdc17233870c907bdf65cb357ec0bd86808fb", "text_chars": 311}
